From d614b330776cc93559945dc0ffacea331bb82c27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Janek210102j <janek210102j@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:34:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] One consistent look across the site and admin

- Fonts: the body font was 'Roboto ' (stray space), which never matched,
  so every page fell back to monospace. Self-host Cinzel (headings, menu,
  buttons; echoes the logo) and Source Sans 3 (text).
- Page titles: same font, size and distance from the menu on every page
  (were 120-240px down on desktop, up to 476px on phones).
- One background colour (#0A060D) for html, pages and footer.
- One button style (square outline, gold Cinzel) for public buttons,
  ticket links and the login/contact forms; Bootstrap blue focus replaced
  with gold; the menu shows the current page.
- Releases: static gold light instead of a mouse-following glow that
  re-rendered the page on every mouse move.
- Admin: dashboard and editor top bars restyled to match the site (no
  emoji, no status strip), each card shows what's live right now (next
  show, merch sync, what the press kit is missing). Admin buttons share
  one style. Cards stack on phones.
- Centred menu breakpoint moved to 1600px so the wider font never runs
  into the logo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0115yEir6TJxrDkkp9hfACwd
